{"id": "3987", "revid": "162256", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=3987", "title": "Blanchard", "text": "Blanchard is a small agricultural township in the Red River Valley of North Dakota, between Fargo and Grand Forks.\nGet in.\nBy car.\nFrom I-29, take exit 100 west on state Highway 200A for 8 miles.\nEat.\nNo commercial accommodations; closest are in Hillsboro, Halstad or Hatton."}
